      "rationale": "L3 explicitly states the HA epitope at position 163 is localized extracellularly by IF in intact cells, and the tagged protein confers drug resistance. Python lookup confirms residue 163 = E and residue 164 = D, within the extracellular span 158-172. The loop is 15 residues long with the insertion point 6 residues from the nearest TM boundary, satisfying the >=3 residue constraint. Full-length MRP1/ABCC1 with HA epitope inserted at position 163, expressed in HeLa cells. The extracellular loop 158-172 (MSD1, ECL2) is 15 residues long; position 163 is 6 residues from the proximal TM boundary (157) and 10 from the distal (173).",
